  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam-Modernizing the Vietnam Association of Certified Public Accountant (VACPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is consistent with draft of the 2012- 2016 Country Partnership Strategycomma Pillar 1- Competitivenesscomma which the Bank indicated that the Bank will work closely with the accounting and auditing professional bodies to strengthen the quality of corporate financial. This is also in line with the recommendations made in the Accounting and Auditing Report of Observance of Standards and Codes (ROSC) 2008 which recommended capacity strengthening for the VACPA on the better management of and better supports provided to its members to adopt and disseminate the standards in line with International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRSs) and International Standards on Auditing (ISAs)comma though which develop the auditing and accounting profession in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
